  Gain ^green;13^reset;% Jump and ^green;6^reset;% Run Speed^reset;, Fall Damage x^green;0.8^reset;
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;15^reset;% Ice,+^cyan;5^reset;% Electric
  ^cyan;Nightvision^reset;
  Tech: ^green;Razor Claws^reset;
